{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30930","headline":"寄浙右旧幕僚 · 孟迟","name":"寄浙右旧幕僚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"由来恶舌驷难追，自古无媒谤所归。\n勾践岂能容范蠡，李斯何暇救韩非。\n巨拳岂爲鸡挥肋，强弩那因鼠发机。\n惭愧故人同鲍叔，此心江柳尚依依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟迟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}